Secret values can belong to a jet. A jet value is used first for that jet's commands, flight plans and files, followed by the server and partner, server, partner and global values. The partner is the jet's partner, or the server's partner when the jet has none. Jet values are managed in the Secrets tab of the jet, are deleted with the jet, and are not copied when a jet is cloned. Duplicating a key no longer copies its secret values. server_validate_secret accepts an optional jet reference.
